4740	{"artifactId":"LLD-386a3d4a69d333df-s1","entry":{"id":"migrated-LLD-386a3d4a69d333df-s1-review","actor":{"id":"insrc:controller","kind":"agent","properties":{}},"timestamp":"2026-08-07T10:21:02.282Z","operation":"review","outcome":{"result":"pass","summary":"review: pass","data":{"kind":"review","report":{"artifact":"design.story","stage":"design.story","verdict":"pass","findings":[{"claimId":"cl1","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"OllamaProvider.embed() calls this.client.embed({ model, input }) WITHOUT a keep_alive argument (the bug this Story fixes).","evidence":"CONFIRMED verbatim: src/agent/providers/ollama.ts:425 reads `const result = await this.client.embed({ model: this.embeddingModel, input: text });` — no keep_alive argument, exactly the bug the Story fixes.","action":"None — fix site verified.","fixability":"auto"},{"claimId":"cl2","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"The shaper path complete()/chat() pins keep_alive:'24h' (the pattern embed() will mirror).","evidence":"Supported: the shaper path complete()/chat() pins keep_alive:'24h' (ollama.ts:342 conditional keepAlive + ln 501 literal '24h'), verified by direct inspection this session — the pattern embed() mirrors.","action":"None.","fixability":"auto"},{"claimId":"cl3","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"The config catalog registers a models.local.* block (host/embeddingModel/embeddingDim/coreModel/charsPerToken) where an additive models.local.embeddingKeepAlive field is registered.","evidence":"Supported: config-catalog.ts registers the models.local.* block (models.local.host/embeddingModel/embeddingDim/coreModel/charsPerToken at ln 111-116), the additive registration site for models.local.embeddingKeepAlive.","action":"None.","fixability":"auto"},{"claimId":"cl4","kind":"citation","severity":"LOW","premise":"loadLocalProviderConfig (src/config/local.ts) is the local-provider config surface OllamaProvider reads via localDefaults(); it is where embeddingKeepAlive is